    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: 'Create Virtual Players with "Multiplayer Play Mode", then press "Play".

    You
    may start a host or client via the buttons on the right, or via the inspector
    of the NetworkManager, or via code.

    When you see the cube, you can move
    it with the keys W, A, S, D'
